https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/compare/main...seberatolmez:OpenHands:fix/usage-panel-cost-transparency?expand=1&title=fix%28frontend%29%3A+make+usage-panel+cost+transparent+and+attributable&body=%23+PR%3A+fix%28frontend%29%3A+make+usage-panel+cost+transparent+and+attributable%0A%0A%23%23+Problem%0A%0AThe+Usage+panel%27s+%2A%2ATotal+Cost%2A%2A+is+the+agent-server%27s+%60accumulated_cost%60+%E2%80%94+an+estimate+from+litellm%27s+static+pricing+table%2C+recorded+only+for+calls+that+could+actually+be+priced.+Nothing+in+the+UI+says+that.+A+session+with+20.1M+tokens+next+to+%60%240.0030%60+reads+as+a+billing+figure+and+as+%22this+session+was+free%22.+Both+wrong%3A+the+provider+billed+per+its+own+rate+card%2C+and+the+tiny+%28or+zero%29+number+usually+means+%2Apricing+data+was+missing%2A%2C+not+%2Ano+spend%2A.%0A%0AServer-side+cost+pipeline+%28unchanged+here%2C+documented+in+the+linked+issue%29%3A%0A%0A%60%60%60%0Ausage+id+%28agent+%7C+condenser+%7C+profile%3A%3Cname%3E+%7C+%E2%80%A6%29%0A++%E2%94%94%E2%94%80+per-call+cost+%3D+litellm+model_cost%5Bresolved+model%5D%0A++++++++++++++++++++++%28%2B+proxy+cost+header+%2F+custom_rate+override%29%0A+++++%E2%94%94%E2%94%80+MetricsSnapshot.accumulated_cost+++%280.0+when+model+unpriceable%29%0A++++++++%E2%94%94%E2%94%80+WS+ConversationStateUpdateAgentStats+%2F+conversation+stats+REST%0A+++++++++++%E2%94%94%E2%94%80+UI+combineUsageMetrics%28%29+sums+ids+%E2%86%92+%22Total+Cost%22%0A%60%60%60%0A%0AThe+per-usage-id+detail+travels+all+the+way+to+the+UI+and+is+then+dropped%3A+the+panel+sums+it+away.+That+is+the+one+piece+of+data+that+makes+the+total+%2Aattributable%2A.%0A%0A%23%23+What+changes%0A%0A%7C+Where+%7C+Change+%7C%0A%7C---%7C---%7C%0A%7C+Usage+tab+total+%7C+estimate+note%3A+%2A%22Estimated+from+model+pricing+%E2%80%94+may+differ+from+what+your+provider+bills.%22%2A+%7C%0A%7C+Zero-cost+case+%7C+tokens+%3E+0+but+cost+%3D%3D+0+%E2%86%92+%2A%22No+cost+data+reported+for+the+models+used+%E2%80%94+pricing+may+be+unavailable.%22%2A+instead+of+a+bare+%60%240.0000%60+%7C%0A%7C+New+%22By+model%22+section+%7C+per-usage-id+rows+%28model+name%2C+its+accumulated+cost%2C+its+input%2Foutput+tokens%29+under+the+total%2C+rendered+when+more+than+one+usage+id+contributed+%7C%0A%7C+Data+flow+%7C+%60usage_breakdown%60+threaded+through+%60agent-server-conversation-service.types.ts%60+%E2%86%92+%60combineUsageMetrics%60+%28keys+%60usage_to_metrics%60+by+usage+id%29+%E2%86%92+WS+stats+handler+%E2%86%92+metrics+store+%E2%86%92+%60useLiveConversationMetrics%60+%7C%0A%7C+i18n+%7C+3+new+keys+%28%60CONVERSATION%24COST_ESTIMATE_NOTE%60%2C+%60CONVERSATION%24NO_COST_DATA%60%2C+%60CONVERSATION%24BY_MODEL%60%29+translated+for+all+16+locales%3B+%60declaration.ts%60+regenerated+via+%60make-i18n%60+%7C%0A%7C+ACP+plan+note+%7C+existing+plan-usage+note+no+longer+hides+the+cost+section+%7C%0A%0AThe+combined+%2A%2ATotal+Cost%2A%2A+value+itself+is+unchanged+%E2%80%94+same+%60accumulated_cost%60+sum+as+before.+What+changes+is+what+the+panel+tells+you+about+that+number.%0A%0A%23%23+Before+%2F+after%0A%0APreview%3A+%28rendered+mock%3A+%5Bhtmlpreview%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fhtmlpreview.github.io%2F%3Fhttps%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2Fseberatolmez%2FOpenHands%2Ffix%2Fusage-panel-cost-transparency%2F.pr%2Fdesign.html%29%29%0A%0A%60%60%60%0ABefore++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++After%0A%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80+++++++++%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%0AToken+Usage+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++Token+Usage%0AInput++++++19%2C747%2C245+++++++++++++++++++Input++++++19%2C747%2C245%0ACache+Hit++18%2C989%2C568+++++++++++++++++++Cache+Hit++18%2C989%2C568%0ACache+Write++++++++0+++++++++++++++++++++Cache+Write++++++++0%0AOutput++++++415%2C535++++++++++++++++++++++Output++++++415%2C535%0ATotal++++++20%2C162%2C780+++++++++++++++++++Total++++++20%2C162%2C780%0ATotal+Cost++++%240.0030+++++++++++++++++++Total+Cost++++%240.0030%0A++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++%E2%9A%A0+No+cost+data+reported+for+the%0A++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++models+used+%E2%80%94+pricing+may+be%0A++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++unavailable.%0A++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++By+model%0A++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++openai%2Fgpt-4o-mini+++%240.0030%0A%60%60%60%0A%0A%23%23+Files%0A%0A%60%60%60%0Asrc%2Fapi%2Fconversation-service%2Fagent-server-conversation-service.types.ts++%7C+UsageBreakdownEntry+type+%2B+MetricsSnapshot+field%0Asrc%2Futils%2Fconversation-metrics.ts++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++%7C+combineUsageMetrics+aggregates+usage_to_metrics%0Asrc%2Fcontexts%2Fconversation-websocket-context.tsx++++++++++++++++++++++++++%7C+stats+handler+maps+breakdown+into+store%0Asrc%2Fstores%2Fmetrics-store.ts++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++%7C+breakdown+state+%2B+reset%0Asrc%2Fhooks%2Fuse-live-conversation-metrics.ts+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++%7C+exposes+breakdown+%28also%3A+per-field+selectors%29%0Asrc%2Fcomponents%2Ffeatures%2Fconversation%2Fusage-panel%2Fusage-panel.tsx+++++++++%7C+estimate+note+%2B+zero-cost+flag+%2B+ACP+note+placement%0Asrc%2Fcomponents%2Ffeatures%2Fconversation%2Fusage-panel%2Fmodel-breakdown.tsx+++++%7C+new+%22By+model%22+section%0Asrc%2Fcomponents%2Ffeatures%2Fconversation%2Fmetrics-modal%2Fcost-section.tsx++++++%7C+estimate+note+%2B+no-cost-data+state%0Asrc%2Fi18n%2Ftranslation.json+%28%2B+declaration.ts+via+make-i18n%29+++++++++++++++%7C+3+keys+%C3%97+16+locales%0A%60%60%60%0A%0A%23%23+Testing%0A%0A-+%2A%2ANew%2A%2A%3A+%60__tests__%2Futils%2Fconversation-metrics.test.ts%60+%28breakdown+aggregation%2C+ordering%2C+backward-compat+with+absent+%60usage_to_metrics%60%29%2C+%60__tests__%2Fcomponents%2Ffeatures%2Fconversation%2Fusage-panel%2Fmodel-breakdown.test.tsx%60%2C+%60__tests__%2Fcomponents%2Ffeatures%2Fconversation%2Fmetrics-modal%2Fcost-section.test.tsx%60+%28estimate+note+%2B+no-cost-data+state%29%0A-+%2A%2AUpdated%2A%2A%3A+agent-server-adapter+%28%2316480+test+now+also+asserts+the+breakdown%29%2C+use-live-conversation-metrics%2C+and+the+two+context-compaction+hook+test+fixtures%0A-+Full+suite%3A+%2A%2A816+files+%2F+9%2C297+tests+passing%2A%2A%3B+%60npm+run+typecheck%60%2C+%60eslint+src%60%2C+%60prettier+--check%60%2C+and+translation-completeness+all+clean%0A%0A%23%23+Human+review+checklist%0A%0A-+%5B+%5D+Wording+of+both+notes+%28EN+strings%3B+locales+auto-checked+for+completeness%2C+not+fluency%29%0A-+%5B+%5D+%22By+model%22+visibility+rule%3A+shown+only+when+%E2%89%A5+2+usage+ids+contributed+%E2%80%94+render+for+%60n+%3D%3D+1%60+too%3F%0A-+%5B+%5D+Zero-cost+flag+threshold%3A+triggers+when+accumulated+cost+is+exactly+0+with+tokens+%3E+0%0A-+%5B+%5D+Backend+contract%3A+relies+on+%60usage_to_metrics%5B%2A%5D.model_name%60+staying+in+the+stats+payload%0A%0A%23%23+AGENT+section%0A%0A-+Agent%3A+OpenHands%0A-+This+PR+was+produced+end-to-end+by+an+OpenHands+agent+at+the+user%27s+request%3B+the+user+reviewed+the+analysis+and+is+submitting+it.%0A&draft=1